obj_id: agentGenerated_MonthlySalesKPIPerformanceChart-4b4f9ac0
liveboard:
  name: agentGenerated_Monthly Sales KPI Performance Chart
  visualizations:
  - id: Viz_1
    viz_guid: 15256375-3ebd-404f-a378-ba01c6e2c245
    note_tile:
      html_parsed_string: |-
        Key Drivers:
        • Fall/winter seasonality drives peak performance with Q4 consistently strongest
        • November 2024 achieved highest monthly sales at 118,448
        • 4-year upward trend shows sustained growth from Feb 2021-Dec 2024
        • September-December period accounts for top performing months across all years

        Recommendations:
        • Increase inventory and marketing investment during Q4 seasonal peak period
        • Analyze November 2024 success factors to replicate in other months
        • Focus promotional campaigns on fall/winter months to maximize seasonal trends
